<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal global trade deficit 1.4 trln esc Jan-Nov.</title>
<headline>Portugal global trade deficit 1.4 trln esc Jan-Nov.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal's global trade deficit rose to 1,398 billion escudos between January and November from 1,391.4 billion in the same period last year, the National Statistics Institute (INE) said.</p>
<p>		     Jan-Nov 96  Jan-Nov 95  Nov 96   Oct 95</p>
<p> Overall balance   -1,398.1  -1,391.4    -182.3   -138.3</p>
<p> Imports		4,803.8   4,616.2     480.1    481.8</p>
<p> Exports		3,405.7   3,224.8     297.8    343.5</p>
<p>Note - Figures are in billions of escudos. A minus sign denotes a deficit. 1995 figures are definitive while 1996 figures are preliminary.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +(351-1) 3538254</p>
</text>
